# /etc/systemd/system/funding-shadow.service
# DEX 間ファンディング・スクリーナー (シャドーモード)。売買しないので秘密鍵も API キーも持たない。
# arb-shadow.service と同じサンドボックス。EnvironmentFile は Webhook の設定だけ。
[Unit]
Description=trade-bot-factory cross-DEX funding screener (shadow mode)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
User=arb
Group=arb
WorkingDirectory=/opt/trade-bot-factory
# WEBHOOK_URL / FUNDING_URL_<VENUE> はここに書く (root だけ読める)
EnvironmentFile=-/etc/arb/funding-env
ExecStartPre=/usr/bin/python3 -m tbf.funding check --config /opt/trade-bot-factory/funding.toml
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 -m tbf.funding run \
  --config /opt/trade-bot-factory/funding.toml \
  --db /var/lib/funding/funding.sqlite
Restart=always
RestartSec=30

# ---- サンドボックス: 乗っ取られても被害を広げない ----
NoNewPrivileges=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
PrivateTmp=true
PrivateDevices=true
ProtectKernelTunables=true
ProtectKernelModules=true
ProtectKernelLogs=true
ProtectControlGroups=true
ProtectClock=true
ProtectHostname=true
RestrictSUIDSGID=true
RestrictRealtime=true
RestrictNamespaces=true
LockPersonality=true
MemoryDenyWriteExecute=true
RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_INET AF_INET6 AF_UNIX
CapabilityBoundingSet=
SystemCallArchitectures=native
SystemCallFilter=@system-service
SystemCallFilter=~@privileged
StateDirectory=funding
ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/funding
UMask=0077

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
